    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bricks 10x10</strong> is a strategic puzzle game that looks simple\u2014but quickly reveals its depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and combine bricks on a 10x10 grid. Clear lines, trigger combos, and master clever gimmicks like brick swapping, respawning, and transforming tiles. While luck may play a part, skilled players will discover that every board has a hidden path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, trying to beat your combo record, or just enjoying a relaxing brain teaser, <strong>Bricks 10x10</strong> delivers a fresh twist on classic puzzle mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>10x10 Grid Puzzle Gameplay</strong>: Think carefully, plan ahead, and place bricks to clear space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Brick Gimmicks</strong>: Use swap, respawn, and magic bricks to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Combo &amp; Rank System</strong>: Chain your moves and climb the global rankings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>: Compete with players around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Accessible, Yet Deep</strong>: Easy to pick up, tough to master.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bricks 10x10</strong> is a strategic puzzle game that looks simple\u2014but quickly reveals its depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and combine bricks on a 10x10 grid. Clear lines, trigger combos, and master clever gimmicks like brick swapping, respawning, and transforming tiles. While luck may play a part, skilled players will discover that every board has a hidden path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores, trying to beat your combo record, or just enjoying a relaxing brain teaser, <strong>Bricks 10x10</strong> delivers a fresh twist on classic puzzle mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>10x10 Grid Puzzle Gameplay</strong>: Think carefully, plan ahead, and place bricks to clear space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Brick Gimmicks</strong>: Use swap, respawn, and magic bricks to turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Combo &amp; Rank System</strong>: Chain your moves and climb the global rankings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>: Compete with players around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Accessible, Yet Deep</strong>: Easy to pick up, tough to master.</p></li></ul>",
